UI: SDD

Purpose:
  UI testing — verify interface behavior, rendering, and user
  interactions. UI tests validate that the frontend displays correctly
  and responds to user input as expected.

Owns: ./

Scope:
  Component rendering
  Page layouts
  User interactions (clicks, inputs, navigation)
  Visual regression
  Accessibility
  Responsive behavior

Principles:
  Test behavior, not implementation
  Use accessible selectors (not CSS classes)
  Test user-visible changes only
  Keep UI tests maintainable
  Avoid testing third-party components

Structure:
  Every UI test MUST:
    interact with the UI as a user would
    verify visible outcomes
    clean up state
    be independent of other tests

Frameworks:
  React: Testing Library, Cypress
  Vue: Vue Test Utils, Cypress
  Angular: TestBed, Cypress
  General: Playwright, Cypress, Selenium

Navigation:
  Project: @project/project.sdd
  Workflow: @workflow/testing.sdd
  TestLevels: @levels.sdd
  TestTypes: @types.sdd
  TestGates: @gates.sdd
  BDD: @bdd.sdd
  Unit: @unit.sdd
  E2E: @e2e.sdd
  ProjectTesting: @projects/vkard.az/testing/INDEX.sdd

